  "description": "Station View is a brand-new residential development consisting of Studio, 1, 2- & 3-bedroom apartments and duplexes located at “The Crossings” Adamstown.  The scheme is excellently positioned adjacent to Adamstown train station, which has a peak journey time of 12-minutes to Heuston Station. This new destination includes an array of amenities and services to support residents in their new homes and community.   \r\n\r\nStation View is part of “The Crossings” development with a superb offering of spacious apartment types which are expertly designed to cater for all needs of today’s lifestyles. Consisting of a range of layouts and unit types, the key features include modern kitchen, living room with spacious balcony, bedrooms with fitted wardrobes and master ensuite, separate utility room and an abundance of storage.   \r\n\r\nThe key features include. \r\n•\tHigh Quality Modern Apartments\r\n•\t“Nordmende” Appliances\r\n•\tBespoke Fit Out \r\n•\tSpacious Layouts\r\n•\tStorage Rooms\r\n•\tSeparate Utility Rooms\r\n•\tAll bedrooms with fitted wardrobes and storage \r\n•\tWell designed and maintained secure landscaped grounds. \r\n•\tLarge private terraces or balconies\r\n•\tA2 Rated\r\n\r\nThe interiors have been tastefully designed by Total Fitout Interiors.\r\nThe development also offers a range of onsite shared amenities and services which include:\r\n•\tParcel Collection \r\n•\tLounge Area\r\n•\tKitchen / Dining Room\r\n•\tBusiness Centre \r\n•\tGames Room\r\n•\tCommunal space\r\n\r\n\r\nThe Crossings\" as a destination includes a significant retail amenity, Tesco, Aldi, a new three-acre public park. This, combineThe interiors have been tastefully designed by Total Fitout Interiors.\r\nThe development also offers a range of onsite shared amenities and services which include:d with a host of childcare, primary and secondary schools, ensures that Station View residents have all that they need on their doorstep. \r\n\r\nIt is a short distance from the N3 and M50 Motorways, providing easy access in and out of Dublin City Centre and further afield for people who drive. The development is also close to a host of key employment hubs including Grange Castle and Park West Business Campus’ as well as Intel Leixlip. There are also regular bus services to “The Crossings” with the 25B and 25 D bus / terminus just minutes’ walk away. \r\n\r\nRegister your interest now to arrange a viewing to be part of this exciting new community.",
